  "no_formula_reason": "The scoring launch executes the pinned vLLM 0.11.0 Mistral3 int4-AWQ runtime after a project-owned CPU closure. The closure hash-checks all material model, AWQ, embedding/linear, norm, rotary, activation, attention/cache, logits/sampler/output/scheduler Python modules plus the vLLM and FlashAttention binaries; it then executes both production AWQLinearMethod.apply branches, vLLM native embedding/RMSNorm/RoPE/SiLU/dense paths, production QKV split and prefill-to-cached-decode attention routing, decoder ordering, vocabulary projection, project-owned final-axis first-index argmax, and the checkpoint's complete EOS set. Independent pure-torch/scalar tests cover the same selected formulas. The deployment probe intentionally hides CUDA, so compiled kernels are honestly treated as pinned trusted dependencies rather than represented as CPU-executed source; pilot_budget rechecks this exact closure and argv before every scoring launch."
}
